Hulls"></span>1. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_34" data-source="" data-orig="What Are Flaxseed Hulls">What Are Flaxseed Hulls</span>?<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p data-start="683" data-end="928"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_35" data-source="" data-orig="Flaxseed hulls are the">Flaxseed hulls are the</span> <strong data-start="706" data-end="734"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_36" data-source="" data-orig="outer layer of flaxseeds">outer layer of flaxseeds</span></strong> (<span class ="tr_" id="tr_37" data-source="" data-orig="Linum usitatissimum">Linum usitatissimum</span>), <span class ="tr_" id="tr_38" data-source="" data-orig="separated during dehulling">separated during dehulling</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_39" data-source="" data-orig="While traditionally considered a byproduct">While traditionally considered a byproduct</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_40" data-source="" data-orig="these hulls are now recognized as a">these hulls are now recognized as a</span> <strong data-start="866" data-end="925"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_41" data-source="" data-orig="rich source of dietary fiber">rich source of dietary fiber</span>, リグナン, および抗酸化物質</strong>.</p><h3 data-start="930" data-end="971"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Key_Nutrients_in_Flaxseed_Hulls"></span><strong data-start="934" data-end="969"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_42" data-source="" data-orig="Key Nutrients in Flaxseed Hulls">Key Nutrients in Flaxseed Hulls</span></strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><ul data-start="972" data-end="1557"><li data-start="972" data-end="1228"><strong data-start="974" data-end="985"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_43" data-source="" data-orig="Lignans">Lignans</span></strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_44" data-source="" data-orig="Flaxseed hulls contain up to">Flaxseed hulls contain up to</span> <strong data-start="1016" data-end="1029">800 <span class ="tr_" id="tr_45" data-source="" data-orig="times">times</span></strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_46" data-source="" data-orig="more lignans than most other plant foods">more lignans than most other plant foods</span> (<span class ="tr_" id="tr_47" data-source="" data-orig="Cunnane et al.">Cunnane et al.</span>, 1995). <span class ="tr_" id="tr_48" data-source="" data-orig="Lignans are">Lignans are</span> <strong data-start="1107" data-end="1132"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_49" data-source="" data-orig="powerful antioxidants">powerful antioxidants</span></strong> そして <strong data-start="1137" data-end="1155"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_50" data-source="" data-orig="phytoestrogens">phytoestrogens</span></strong>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_51" data-source="" data-orig="which can support">which can support</span> <strong data-start="1175" data-end="1195"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_52" data-source="" data-orig="hormonal balance">hormonal balance</span></strong> そして <strong data-start="1200" data-end="1225"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_53" data-source="" data-orig="cardiovascular health">cardiovascular health</span></strong>.</li><li data-start="1229" data-end="1387"><strong data-start="1231" data-end="1248">食物繊維</strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_54" data-source="" data-orig="Over">Over</span> <strong data-start="1255" data-end="1265">50-60%</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_55" data-source="" data-orig="of flaxseed hulls are">of flaxseed hulls are</span> <strong data-start="1288" data-end="1307"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_56" data-source="" data-orig="insoluble fiber">insoluble fiber</span></strong>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_57" data-source="" data-orig="making them excellent for">making them excellent for</span> <strong data-start="1335" data-end="1363"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_58" data-source="" data-orig="gut health and digestion">gut health and digestion</span></strong> (<span class ="tr_" id="tr_59" data-source="" data-orig="Oomah et al.">Oomah et al.</span>, 1996).</li><li data-start="1388" data-end="1557"><strong data-start="1390" data-end="1412">タンパク質 &amp; ミネラル<