iet">in your product line or diet</span>? <span class ="tr_" id="tr_228" data-source="" data-orig="Contact me">Contact me</span>!</p><h2 data-start="0" data-end="35"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="FAQs_About_Flaxseed_Hulls"></span><strong data-start="4" data-end="33"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_229" data-source="" data-orig="FAQs About Flaxseed Hulls">FAQs About Flaxseed Hulls</span></strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><h4 data-start="37" data-end="83"><strong data-start="42" data-end="81">1. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_230" data-source="" data-orig="What are flaxseed hulls made of">What are flaxseed hulls made of</span>?</strong></h4><p data-start="84" data-end="341"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_231" data-source="" data-orig="Flaxseed hulls are the">Flaxseed hulls are the</span> <strong data-start="107" data-end="135"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_232" data-source="" data-orig="outer shell of flaxseeds">outer shell of flaxseeds</span></strong>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_233" data-source="" data-orig="primarily composed of">primarily composed of</span> <strong data-start="159" data-end="228"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_234" data-source="" data-orig="dietary fiber">dietary fiber</span>, リグナン, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_235" data-source="" data-orig="and small amounts of protein and minerals">and small amounts of protein and minerals</span></strong>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_236" data-source="" data-orig="They contain significantly more">They contain significantly more</span> <strong data-start="262" data-end="273">リグナン</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_237" data-source="" data-orig="than whole flaxseeds">than whole flaxseeds</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_238" data-source="" data-orig="making them a great source of antioxidants">making them a great source of antioxidants</span>.</p><h4 data-start="343" data-end="411"><strong data-start="348" data-end="409">2. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_239" data-source="" data-orig="How are flaxseed hulls different from whole flaxseeds">How are flaxseed hulls different from whole flaxseeds</span>?</strong></h4><p data-start="412" data-end="723"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_240" data-source="" data-orig="Whole flaxseeds contain">Whole flaxseeds contain</span> <strong data-start="436" data-end="476"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_241" data-source="" data-orig="more omega-3 fatty acids and protein">more omega-3 fatty acids and protein</span></strong>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_242" data-source="" data-orig="while flaxseed hulls are">while flaxseed hulls are</span> <strong data-start="503" data-end="534"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_243" data-source="" data-orig="richer in fiber and lignans">richer in fiber and lignans</span></strong>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_244" data-source="" data-orig="The hulls are typically used for">The hulls are typically used for</span> <strong data-start="569" data-end="625"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_245" data-source="" data-orig="fiber supplements">fiber supplements</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_246" data-source="" data-orig="functional foods">functional foods</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_247" data-source="" data-orig="and animal feed">and animal feed</span></strong>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_248" data-source="" data-orig="whereas whole flaxseeds are often used for">whereas whole flaxseeds are often used for</span> <strong data-start="670" data-end="720"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_249" data-source="" data-orig="oil extraction">oil extraction</span>, ベーキング, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_250" data-source="" data-orig="and direct consumption">and direct consumption</span></strong>.</p><h4 data-start="725" data-end="786"><strong data-start="730" data-end="784">3. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_251" data-source="" data-orig="What are the health benefits of flaxseed hulls">What are the health benefits of flaxseed hulls</span>?</strong></h4><p data-start="787" data-end="840"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_252" data-source="" data-orig="Flaxseed hulls provide several benefits">Flaxseed hulls provide several benefits</span>, 含む:</p><ul data-start="841" data-end="1095"><li data-start="841" data-end="894"><strong data-start="843" data-end="865"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_253" data-source="" data-orig="Improved digestion">Improved digestion</span></strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_254" data-source="" data-orig="due to high fiber content">due to high fiber content</span>.</li><li data-start="895" data-end="970"><strong data-start="897" data-end="917"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_255" data-source="" data-orig="Hormonal balance">Hormonal balance</span></strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_256" data-source="" data-orig="from lignans">from lignans</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_257" data-source="" data-orig="which act as natural phytoestrogens">which act as natural phytoestrogens</span>.</li><li data-start="971" data-end="1032"><strong data-start="973" data-end="996"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_258" data-source="" data-orig="Antioxidant support">Antioxidant support</span></strong>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_259" data-source="" data-orig="helping reduce oxidative stress">helping reduce oxidative stress</span>.</li><li data-start="1033" data-end="1095"><strong data-start="1035" data-end="1051"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_260" data-source="" data-orig="Heart health">Heart health</span></strong>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_261" data-source="" data-orig="as fiber helps lower cholesterol levels">as fiber helps lower cholesterol levels</span>.</li></ul><h4 data-start="1097" data-end="1148"><strong data-start="1102" data-end="1146">4. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_262" data-source="" data-orig="Can flaxseed hulls be used in baking">Can flaxseed hulls be used in baking</span>?</strong></h4><p data-start="1149" data-end="1380">はい! <span class ="tr_" id="tr_263" data-source="" data-orig="Flaxseed hulls are often added to">Flaxseed hulls are often added to</span> <strong data-start="1188" data-end="1219">パン, マフィン, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_264" data-source="" data-orig="and cookies">and cookies</span></strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_265" data-source="" data-orig="to increase fiber content and enhance texture">to increase fiber content and enhance texture</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_266" data-source="" data-orig="They work well in">They work well in</span> <strong data-start="1285" data-end="1307">グルテンフリーのベーキング</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_267" data-source="" data-orig="as a fiber supplement and">as a fiber supplement and</span> <strong data-start="1334" data-end="1353"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_268" data-source="" data-orig="egg replacement">egg replacement</span></strong> (<span class ="tr_" id="tr_269" data-source="" data-orig="when mixed with water">when mixed with water</span>).</p><h4 data-start="1382" data-end="1440"><strong data-start="1387" data-end="1438">5. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_270" data-source="" data-orig="Are flaxseed hulls suitable for animal feed">Are flaxseed hulls suitable for animal feed</span>?</strong></h4><p data-start="1441" data-end="1663"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_271" data-source="" data-orig="Absolutely">Absolutely</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_272" data-source="" data-orig="Flaxseed hulls are used in">Flaxseed hulls are used in</span> <strong data-start="1480" data-end="1513"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_273" data-source="" data-orig="cattle">cattle</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_274" data-source="" data-orig="poultry">poultry</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_275" data-source="" data-orig="and pet food">and pet food</span></strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_276" data-source="" data-orig="for their">for their</span> <strong data-start="1524" data-end="1553"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_277" data-source="" data-orig="digestive health benefits">digestive health benefits</span></strong>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_278" data-source="" data-orig="Studies show they can">Studies show they can</span> <strong data-start="1577" data-end="1615"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_279" data-source="" data-orig="improve milk quality in dairy cows">improve milk quality in dairy cows</span></strong> そして <strong data-start="1620" data-end="1660"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_280" data-source="" data-orig="enhance egg nutrition in laying hens">enhance egg nutrition in laying hens</span></strong>.</p><h4 data-start="1665" data-end="1741"><strong data-start="1670" data-end="1739">6. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_281" data-source="" data-orig="What’s the difference between brown and golden flaxseed hulls">What’s the difference between brown and golden flaxseed hulls</span>?</strong></h4><p data-start="1742" data-end="1789"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_282" data-source="" data-orig="Both varieties provide similar benefits">Both varieties provide similar benefits</span>, しかし:</p><ul data-start="1790" data-end="2014"><li data-start="1790" data-end="1887"><strong data-start="1792" data-end="1817"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_283" data-source="" data-orig="Golden flaxseed hulls">Golden flaxseed hulls</span></strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_284" data-source="" data-orig="have a">have a</span> <strong data-start="1825" data-end="1850"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_285" data-source="" data-orig="milder">milder</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_286" data-source="" data-orig="nuttier taste">nuttier taste</span></strong>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_287" data-source="" data-orig="making them preferred for baking">making them preferred for baking</span>.</li><li data-start="1888" data-end="2014"><strong data-start="1890" data-end="1914"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_288" data-source="" data-orig="Brown flaxseed hulls">Brown flaxseed hulls</span></strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_289" data-source="" data-orig="have a">have a</span> <strong data-start="1922" data-end="1941"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_290" data-source="" data-orig="stronger flavor">stronger flavor</span></strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_291" data-source="" data-orig="and are more commonly used in supplements and industrial applications">and are more commonly used in supplements and industrial applications</span>.</li></ul>`} />
